+++ patch_v25/research/JSRF_V24_XFILE_INDIRECT_METHOD.md	2026-09-07 17:13:20.450730247 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# JSRF v24: indirect method 0x00178F40
+
+The v24 runtime clears the DirectSound startup failure: sub_00116EC0 and sub_0005F350 both return success and startup proceeds into the game's setup path.
+
+The first new unresolved indirect call is target 0x00178F40 from retail return site 0x00177032. Retail disassembly at 0x00176F70 shows the call at 0x0017702F dispatches slot +0x10 of an interface vtable. The target 0x00178F40 is a standalone padding-delimited function: it starts after NOP padding at 0x00178F40, has multiple internal paths, and exits with `ret 0x14` at 0x001791B8; the next padding begins at 0x001791BB.
+
+v24 skipped that method because it was not in the generated dispatch set. Execution then continued with the method's side effects missing and later faulted while processing guest state in DSOUND function 0x001A19D6. v25 therefore preserves 0x00178F40 as a real callable retail function with exact boundary 0x00178F40..0x001791BB. No return value, HRESULT, or game state is forced.
